B.W8=new A.dL("inspect-dishwasher-filter","Look at the tub filter and sump","Unplug the dishwasher (or switch off its breaker) before reaching into the tub. Do not open a sealed pump or motor. Do not reach inside while it is running.","Pull out the lower dish rack. On the tub floor, find the round or square filter you can lift or twist out by hand. Look at the mesh and the shallow well around it for a mat of food, glass, or grease. Do not open the pump under the filter.","The mesh and sump look clear \u2014 no mat of food or standing sludge.","Food, glass, or grease is packed on the filter or in the visible sump.","dishwasher","dishwasher-filter-debris",B.dA,B.a3Y,"dishwasher-filter-debris")
