B.Wi=new A.dL("inspect-dishwasher-door-click","Check that the door latches","Do not bypass the door switch or open a sealed control box. No live electrical testing.","Close the dishwasher door until it is flush with the cabinet. Press at the top-center latch until you feel or hear one solid click. Nothing should be in the seal.",u.g,"It will not click, springs open, or food in the seal keeps it from latching.","dishwasher","dishwasher-door-click",B.j1,B.a7Z,"dishwasher-door-click")
B.a6O=s(["clogged-dishwasher-filter","kinked-or-clogged-dishwasher-drain"],t.s)
